      "writtenOn": "2023-04-20T15:46:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Tom may have a better suggestion but you could put the following block in [include/config.h](http://cs/chromeos_public/src/platform/ec/include/config.h?l\u003d5917) below where `config_chip.h` and `board.h`: \n\n```\n#ifndef CONFIG_RWDATA_ADDRESS \n#define CONFIG_RWDATA_ADDRESS (CONFIG_PROGRAM_MEMORY_BASE + CONFIG_RW_MEM_OFF)\n#endif\n```\n\nThen inside `npcx/config_chip.h` (or maybe `chip/npcx/config_chip-npcx9.h`?) you\u0027d have\n```\n#define CONFIG_RWDATA_ADDRESS (CONFIG_MAPPED_STORAGE_BASE + CONFIG_EC_WRITABLE_STORAGE_OFF)\n```",
