      "message": "Another thought. It looks like `CONFIG_EC_WRITABLE_STORAGE_OFF` is defined as `CONFIG_RW_MEM_OFF` in some places. It would be worth creating a change that changes everything to use `CONFIG_MAPPED_STORAGE_BASE + CONFIG_EC_WRITABLE_STORAGE_OFF` and use `compare_build.sh` to see if there are any boards that fail. If those two values are equivalent for boards that use this code we can just switch everything to that.",
