      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please see my other comment. \"Adding storage definitions that include CONFIG_MAPPED_STORAGE_BASE to header files like board.h cause the size of the ec.bin file to blow up to 1GB. Please see b:273569976 comments #3-#7 for background and let me know if you have suggestions to work around the problem and still remove the #ifdef from runtime code.\" This suggestion has the same issue. I initially tried to use header definitions rather than runtime changes. I suspect this is a solvable problem but I\u0027m not sure of a clean way to solve it inside the EC code base. Suggestions welcome.",
